" wins over the ",[752,1139,1140],{},"NUXT_I18N_*"," variable for the same field.",[748,1143,1144,1145,1148,1149,1152],{},"Not to be confused with the build-time ",[752,1146,1147],{},"DEFAULT_LOCALE"," variable, which replaces ",[752,1150,1151],{},"defaultLocale"," while building and needs no runtime support.",[761,1154,1156],{"id":1155},"what-can-and-cannot-change","What can and cannot change",[816,1158,1159,1169],{},[819,1160,1161],{},[822,1162,1163,1166],{},[825,1164,1165],{},"Setting",[825,1167,1168],{},"At runtime",[832,1170,1171,1195,1205,1221,1231,1240],{},[822,1172,1173,1177],{},[837,1174,1175],{},[752,1176,1151],{},[837,1178,1179,1180,1183,1184,1187,1188,1183,1191,1194],{},"Yes under ",[752,1181,1182],{},"prefix"," and ",[752,1185,1186],{},"no_prefix",". Under ",[752,1189,1190],{},"prefix_except_default",[752,1192,1193],{},"prefix_and_default"," it is fixed at build (its pages are the unprefixed routes); an override is ignored with a warning.",[822,1196,1197,1202],{},[837,1198,1199],{},[752,1200,1201],{},"fallbackLocale",[837,1203,1204],{},"Yes.",[822,1206,1207,1212],{},[837,1208,1209],{},[752,1210,1211],{},"disabledLocales",[837,1213,1214,1215,1217,1218,1220],{},"Adds to the locales disabled at build; never re-enables one. The build default cannot be disabled under ",[752,1216,1190],{}," \u002F ",[752,1219,1193],{},".",[822,1222,1223,1228],{},[837,1224,1225],{},[752,1226,1227],{},"strategy",[837,1229,1230],{},"No. A runtime strategy is ignored with a warning; build one artifact per strategy.",[822,1232,1233,1237],{},[837,1234,1235],{},[752,1236,754],{},[837,1238,1239],{},"Yes: canonical and hreflang take it in place of the build value. On a host of a locale domain the host's own origin still applies.",[822,1241,1242,1247],{},[837,1243,1244],{},[752,1245,1246],{},"locales[].baseUrl",[837,1248,1249,1250,1252],{},"Only in a build that already has locale domains (some ",[752,1251,1246],{}," at build): the path strategy for domains is chosen at build. Without them the override is ignored with a warning. A code that is no locale, or a value that is not an absolute URL, is ignored with a warning. A locale with no domain at build can get one.",[748,1254,1255],{},"Invalid values never break the app. Each case logs one warning per server process:",[1257,1258,1259,1263,1269],"ul",{},[1260,1261,1262],"li",{},"disabling every locale is ignored;",[1260,1264,1265,1266,1268],{},"a ",[752,1267,1151],{}," that is not enabled falls back to the first enabled locale;",[1260,1270,1265,1271,1273],{},[752,1272,1201],{}," that is not enabled keeps the build value if it is enabled, otherwise there is no fallback.",[761,1275,1277],{"id":1276},"read-the-effective-config","Read the effective config",[766,1279,1282],{"className":1280,"code":1281,"language":274,"meta":771,"style":771},"language-vue shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","\u003Cscript setup lang=\"ts\">\nconst { $getI18nConfig } = useNuxtApp()\nconst config = $getI18nConfig() \u002F\u002F build config with overrides applied\n\u003C\u002Fscript>\n",[752,1283,1284,1311,1332,1350],{"__ignoreMap":771},[775,1285,1286,1289,1292,1296,1299,1301,1304,1306,1308],{"class":777,"line":353},[775,1287,1288],{"class":784},"\u003C",[775,1290,1291],{"class":951},"script",[775,1293,1295],{"class":1294},"spNyl"," setup",[775,1297,1298],{"class":1294}," lang",[775,1300,785],{"class":784},[775,1302,1303],{"class":784},"\"",[775,1305,919],{"class":788},[775,1307,1303],{"class":784},[775,1309,1310],{"class":784},">\n",[775,1312,1313,1316,1318,1321,1323,1326,1329],{"class":777,"line":796},[775,1314,1315],{"class":1294},"const",[775,1317,1089],{"class":784},[775,1319,1320],{"class":780}," $getI18nConfig ",[775,1322,1128],{"class":784},[775,1324,1325],{"class":784}," =",[775,1327,1328],{"class":939}," useNuxtApp",[775,1330,1331],{"class":780},"()\n",[775,1333,1334,1336,1339,1341,1344,1347],{"class":777,"line":802},[775,1335,1315],{"class":1294},[775,1337,1338],{"class":780}," config ",[775,1340,785],{"class":784},[775,1342,1343],{"class":939}," $getI18nConfig",[775,1345,1346],{"class":780},"() ",[775,1348,1349],{"class":926},"\u002F\u002F build config with overrides applied\n",[775,1351,1352,1355,1357],{"class":777,"line":808},[775,1353,1354],{"class":784},"\u003C\u002F",[775,1356,1291],{"class":951},[775,1358,1310],{"class":784},[748,1360,1361,1362,1365],{},"Treat it as read-only: on the server it is shared by every request and frozen in development; the browser copy is not frozen. Importing the config from ",[752,1363,1364],{},"#build\u002Fi18n.strategy.mjs"," gives the build values without overrides.",[761,1367,1369],{"id":1368},"origins-at-runtime","Origins at runtime",[748,1371,1372],{},"One build can serve staging and production on different hosts:",[766,1374,1376],{"className":768,"code":1375,"language":770,"meta":771,"style":771},"NUXT_I18N_LOCALE_BASE_URLS=en=https:\u002F\u002Fstaging.example.com,de=https:\u002F\u002Fstaging.example.de \\\nNUXT_I18N_META_BASE_URL=https:\u002F\u002Fstaging.example.com \\\nnode .output\u002Fserver\u002Findex.mjs\n",[752,1377,1378,1400,1405],{"__ignoreMap":771},[775,1379,1380,1382,1384,1386,1388,1391,1393,1395,1398],{"class":777,"line":353},[775,1381,889],{"class":780},[775,1383,785],{"class":784},[775,1385,1032],{"class":780},[775,1387,785],{"class":784},[775,1389,1390],{"class":788},"https:\u002F\u002Fstaging.example.com,",[775,1392,789],{"class":780},[775,1394,785],{"class":784},[775,1396,1397],{"class":788},"https:\u002F\u002Fstaging.example.de",[775,1399,793],{"class":792},[775,1401,1402],{"class":777,"line":796},[775,1403,1404],{"class":780},"NUXT_I18N_META_BASE_URL=https:\u002F\u002Fstaging.example.com \\\n",[775,1406,1407,1409],{"class":777,"line":802},[775,1408,811],{"class":780},[775,1410,814],{"class":788},[748,1412,1413,1414,1416,1417,1419],{},"The hosts of the build then are unknown hosts: they get the build config, as any other host. ",[752,1415,754],{}," (the origin of an unknown host's canonical and hreflang) does not move with them: set ",[752,1418,877],{}," too when the default locale's domain moves. The browser of a server-rendered page gets the changed origins with the page.",[748,1421,1422,1425,1426,1429,1430,1432],{},[752,1423,1424],{},"nuxt generate"," per host (",[752,1427,1428],{},"NUXT_I18N_DOMAIN",") is build time: the prerendered pages keep the origins of the build, and runtime ",[752,1431,758],{},"s do not reach them.",[761,1434,1436],{"id":1435},"disabled-locales-and-static-files","Disabled locales and static files",[748,1438,1439,1440,1443,1444,1220],{},"A runtime-disabled locale answers 404 on its routes and payload route, but its payload files are still in ",[752,1441,1442],{},".output\u002Fpublic\u002F_locales\u002F"," and a static file server returns them. When those files must not be reachable, disable the locale at build time with ",[752,1445,1446],{},"disabled: true",[761,1448,1450],{"id":1449},"related","Related",[1452,1453,1454,1458,1460],"card-group",{},[1455,1456],"card",{"icon":1457,"title":88,"to":89},"i-lucide-book-open",[1455,1459],{"icon":1457,"title":83,"to":84},[1455,1461],{"icon":1457,"title":51,"to":52},[1463,1464,1465],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .sTEyZ, html code.shiki .sTEyZ{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-dark:#BABED8}html pre.shiki code .sMK4o, html code.shiki .sMK4o{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF}html pre.shiki code .sfazB, html code.shiki .sfazB{--shiki-light:#91B859;--shiki-default:#C3E88D;--shiki-dark:#C3E88D}html pre.shiki code .sBMFI, html code.shiki .sBMFI{--shiki-light:#E2931D;--shiki-default:#FFCB6B;--shiki-dark:#FFCB6B}html .light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html.light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);